Package: com.sa1nt.visibleisland
Name: VisibleIsland
Version: 2.0.0
Section: Tweaks
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader, firmware (>= 14.0)
Conflicts: com.cydia.visibleisland, com.sa1nt.visibleisland-legacy
Replaces: com.sa1nt.visibleisland-legacy
Maintainer: Sa1nt <moonwaredlc12@gmail.com>
Author: Sa1nt <moonwaredlc12@gmail.com>
Description: Modular three-section Dynamic Island for devices without one.
 A dedicated status-bar-level UIWindow renders a center pill plus two
 activity satellites, driven by a streaming media engine that loops .gif
 and .mp4 content without ever caching a full frame buffer in RAM.
 Hardware presets cover iPhone 7 through iPhone 13 Pro Max, with 0.5 pt
 manual geometry trimming from the preference bundle.
Tag: purpose::extension, role::enduser, compatible::ios14.0, compatible::ios17.7
